# Quarto build cache + rendered website (artifacts; regenerate with `quarto render`).
/.quarto/
/_site/

# Scratch dir for the standalone self-contained preview render (not committed).
/_preview_src/

# Playwright screenshot scratch.
/.playwright-mcp/

# NOTE: _freeze/ IS committed on purpose — it is the cached executed output
# (the proof the cells ran against live data) and lets `quarto render` reuse
# results without re-hitting the live ESPN endpoints.
